9. Changes
The author may change these terms when the change is to your benefit or is reasonable in light of the purpose of these terms. Before a change takes effect, the author announces the changed terms, what has changed and when the change takes effect on the distribution page (GitHub). The changed terms apply from that date, including to versions installed by automatic update.

